  "solution": {
    "text": "None of the carbon atoms in $\\mathrm{DCH}_{2} \\mathrm{CH}_{2} \\mathrm{CH}_{2} \\mathrm{Cl}$ is chiral i.e., each carbon\natom is achiral (symmetric)."
